      "Fix": "Introduce each abbreviation the first time in-voice with its full term glossed naturally, e.g. \u0027a public-address system\u2014a PA\u2014held together by hope\u0027 and \u0027a caseless-defense-weapon carbine, a CDW, slung across his front,\u0027 before ever using the bare initials again."
