      "Evidence": "This is a dense, structurally maximal short story \u2014 a full green-room-to-shootout-to-hospital-to-epilogue arc with layered worldbuilding (neuretics, mesh handles, Fade/Glass/Candor lore, Fenris Ballistics branding, Waxwing Neuromedia signage, The Low/The Thread geography) all introduced cold, plus a telepathy reveal, two on-page deaths, a gunfight, and a three-months-later coda \u2014 none of which reads like \u0027tuning\u0027 an existing piece for new readers but like the entire house being built from scratch at gateway scope.",
